blasting a wand of cancellation at an altar shouldn't do anything spectacular.
the altar isn't enchanted. it's a special place, that's all! remembering the
10ft. x 10ft analogy for each floor space, blasting any wand at an altar should
not have any effect since the blast doesn't really hit the altar (although
that's your intent). if i had to make an exception i'd let polymorph also
affect altars randomly. sometimes i find it hard to find or generate the much
needed lawful altars if i'm not a lawful character. there is a workaround!

